EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Your account is nearing maturity and currently past due by {!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}. Any payment ran after the loan date of maturity {!Case.NF_WC_Maturity_Date__c} is subject to a $10 per day fee. To minimize this fee, please let us know if you are able to catchup any of the missed payments before this date. We can spread them out if needed, or run as a lump sum.



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
